ines.\n\n7. **Conclusion.**  \n   The necessary condition \\(0\\le k\\le n\\) is also sufficient, because the explicit construction above works for every such \\(k\\). Hence the set of possible numbers of sunny lines is precisely  \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\{0,1,2,\\dots ,n\\}} .\n\\]"
